{%- comment -%}
Soilboy

Sticky category filter bar + Grid/List view toggle for installation-list.

The "active" pill/button is intentionally NOT set here. Which category and
view are actually active depends on the URL's ?category=/?view_mode= or a
remembered localStorage choice, none of which Liquid can read server-side —
guessing here (e.g. always marking "All"/"Grid" active) would flash the
wrong pill before JS's first render() corrects it. JS runs synchronously
immediately after this markup, so it sets the real is-active state before
the neutral one is ever noticeably visible.

Variables:
- el_id: String. Parent section's element id
- categories: Array of installation_category metaobject entries, sorted by
  display_order
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="ill-filter flex ai-center jc-between" data-ill-filter>
  <div class="ill-filter-pills flex ai-center" role="tablist">
    <button type="button" class="ill-pill p2 c-green flex ai-center" data-ill-pill data-category="">
      All<span class="ill-pill-dot"></span>
    </button>
    {% for cat in categories %}
      <button type="button" class="ill-pill p2 c-green flex ai-center" data-ill-pill data-category="{{ cat.system.handle }}">
        {{ cat.name.value }}<span class="ill-pill-dot"></span>
      </button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="ill-view-toggle flex ai-center">
    <span class="ill-view-label p2 c-green">View:</span>
    <button type="button" class="ill-view-btn p2 c-green flex ai-center" data-ill-view-btn data-view="grid">
      Grid<span class="ill-pill-dot"></span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="ill-view-btn p2 c-green flex ai-center" data-ill-view-btn data-view="list">
      List<span class="ill-pill-dot"></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
